This repository distributes no model weights and no converted bundles.

The model it hosts is Ternary Bonsai 2 27B by Prism ML, Inc.
(https://huggingface.co/prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf), released under the
Apache License 2.0. Created using Bonsai by Prism ML.

Bonsai 2 is built from Qwen3.8-27B, Copyright 2026 Alibaba Cloud
(https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B), also available under the Apache
License 2.0.

The separately distributed Core AI artifact is a modified runtime
representation of the PQ2_0 language weights. The conversion recipe that
produces it is published in the community Core AI model zoo
(https://github.com/john-rocky/coreai-model-zoo).
